  "details": "So my gaming laptop might not be the best but I no issues playing on low end since I don’t mind it\n\nBut when I try to update my and driver to 25.10.3 it still having a glitchy screen and freezes and I believe screen tearing and that I’ve been stuck on update 25.4.1 for a couple of years now so I don’t know how to fix this and here is my laptop specs ;\n\nMy gaming Laptop : Victus Hp Laptop\n\nCPU : AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS with Radeon Graphics\n\nGPU: AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics\n\nGPU 1: AMD Radeon TX 6550 something like that\n\nRAM: 16.0 GB (15.2 GB usable)\n\nVR:  Oculus Quest 2\n\nRefresh Rate: 144Hz\n\nAnd I know my laptop is not recommended for vrchat but I’ve been using this for years and it doesn’t bother me when I dance at group or hangout with friends but I just want to see if there’s a solution \n\nBut rn I don’t have money for a big expensive pc nor I have the space for it",
